{"code": 0, "msg": "成功", "data": {"id": 78356, "game_id": 202, "entry_id": 55859, "uid": 40642, "type": 4, "title": "6.17活动建议", "tag": "0", "created_at": 1623842924, "updated_at": 1631090517, "updated_uid": 0, "comment_at": 1624277783, "last_at": 0, "comment_count": 20, "status": 1, "summary": "欢迎来交流群吹水：587777772池子相关建议：对策抽取建议：大部分人抽必中池子就可，冲榜P一下。详细天子技能等分析参考wiki-土星的抽卡建议。BOSS池：不抽，BOSS活动送，也不强。黎明萨图恩", "thumb": "", "model_ids": "", "like_count": 12, "unlike_count": 0, "view_count": 11679, "is_top": 0, "content_type": 0, "is_del": 0, "del_at": 0, "del_uid": 0, "is_release": 0, "source": 0, "last_ip_area": "", "is_prohibit_reply": 0, "is_only": 0, "state": 0, "audit_uid": 0, "favorite_count": 0, "seo": "", "video": "", "vote_ids": "", "is_elite": 0, "is_admin": 0, "audit_state": 0, "chat_game_id": 0, "is_image_text": 0, "from_chat": false, "chat_top": 0, "entry_auto": 1, "audit_at": 0, "server_id": 0, "image_num": 0, "video_list": "", "is_emulator": 0, "editor_type": 0, "ignore_hot": false, "mj_quote_num": 0, "mj_task_id": 0, "limit_age": 0, "important_at": 0, "is_expired": 0, "last_like_at": 0, "version": "", "word_count": 0, "content_id": 78356, "content": "<p class=\"p1\" style=\"\"></p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: center; \"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 140, 0); font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"color:rgb(177,56,206);font-size:20px;font-weight:700;text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">欢迎来交流群吹水：587777772</span></span><br></span></span></span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: center; \"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 140, 0); font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"\">池子相关建议：</span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(177, 56, 206);\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1623834294175_24486931.png\" style=\"height: 64px; width: 64px;\">对策抽取建议</span>：大部分人抽必中池子就可，冲榜P一下。<span style=\"text-decoration-line: underline;\">详细天子技能等分析参考wiki-土星的抽卡建议</span>。</p>\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"\"><br style=\"\"></p>\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"\"><br style=\"\"></p>\n<p class=\"p1\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(177, 56, 206);\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1623834302099_56447113.png\" style=\"height: 64px; width: 64px;\">BOSS池</span>：不抽，BOSS活动送，也不强。</p>\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"\"><br style=\"\"></p>\n<p class=\"p1\" style=\"\"><span style=\"color: rgb(177, 56, 206); font-weight: bold;\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/destinychild/1609491191559_18520405.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_250,w_250\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 20px; width: 64px; height: 64px;\">黎明萨图恩池子</span>：图鉴要有，没必要非得P，但性价比还不错的，暗RAID，暗世界王必上角色。</p>\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"\"><br style=\"\"></p>\n<p class=\"p1\" style=\"\"><span style=\"color: rgb(177, 56, 206); font-weight: bold;\">诸神强袭四人池</span>：鲜花<img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1602314846226_14106654.png\" alt=\"天子全图鉴列表\" style=\"width: 50px; height: 50px;\">、光莫娜<img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1602310308037_20859090.png\" alt=\"天子全图鉴列表\" style=\"width: 50px; height: 49px;\">、黎明萨图恩<img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/destinychild/1609491191559_18520405.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_250,w_250\" style=\"width: 50px; height: 50px;\">、婚八<img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1602310603962_5531119.png\" alt=\"天子全图鉴列表\" style=\"width: 50px; height: 48px;\">。</p>\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"\"><br style=\"\"></p>\n<p class=\"p1\" style=\"\">其中婚八通用性较低，只能RAID出场。鲜花全场景人权没问题。光莫娜和黎明萨图恩是暗系PVE活动通用，价值还不错。</p>\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"\"><br style=\"\"></p>\n<p class=\"p1\" style=\"\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">总体来说可抽，但钻不多建议谨慎为上。</span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"\"><br style=\"\"></p>\n<p class=\"p1\" style=\"\"><span style=\"color: rgb(177, 56, 206); font-weight: bold;\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1623834170250_74654147.png\" style=\"width: 64px; height: 64px;\">魂卡池</span>：冲榜才需要新魂卡，魂卡池往往容易翻车，所以抽不如氪礼包。</p>\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"\"><br style=\"\"></p>\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"\"><br></p>\n<p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: center; \"><span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">RAID活动萌新必读：</span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\" style=\"\">1.伤害低没关系，尽量不要漏票就好，只要不漏票，运气好甚至活动下来比大佬收益高。30分钟自然恢复一张票，不用额外买票。</p>\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"\"><br style=\"\"></p>\n<p class=\"p1\" style=\"\">2.商店尽量换奖励到最后一轮，新出的皮肤在白金箱也可以概率获得，尽量最后换皮肤。</p>\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"\"><br style=\"\"></p>\n<p class=\"p1\" style=\"\">3.多加大佬好友，大佬能帮你斩车，大佬还刷能出好多史莱姆，参与史莱姆战斗可以额外获得很多金币、玛瑙、钻石。</p>\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"\"><br style=\"\"></p>\n<p class=\"p1\" style=\"\">4.低级车不要打，如果车主没上车的时候你就把车打了，等于车主本次车升级失败，会被骂。</p>\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"\"><br style=\"\"></p>\n<p class=\"p1\" style=\"\">5.自己多多发车，车子升级过程中，只要你摸一下车，车子被其他人斩杀，也算你的下次车会正常升级。车子最高40级满。</p>\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"\"><br style=\"\"></p>\n<p class=\"p1\" style=\"\">6.阵容作业参考隔壁raid档期攻略。</p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"\"><br></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"\">7.<span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">自己的车40级以后：</span>自己的车不用打，别人打了你也有奖励，自己的史莱姆要打，打了自己奖励更高。</p>\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"\"><br style=\"\"></p>\n<p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: center; \"><span style=\"color: rgb(10, 75, 238); font-weight: bold;\">MP活动：</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"\">常规必中池，角色养成活动，无额外新增活动。</p>\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"\"><br style=\"\"></p>\n<p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: center; \"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-weight: bold;\">氪金建议：</span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\" style=\"\"><br></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"></span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(177, 56, 206); font-weight: bold;\">礼包更换重点关注：</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);\">1.</span><span style=\"font-weight:bold;color:rgb(0,176,240);\">DP(240rmb)</span>，附魔DP，附魔练度还需要提升的可以买，屯材料等附魔活动</p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\"><br style=\"\"></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);\">2.</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,176,240);font-weight:bold;\">光属性点火支援礼包</span><span style=\"color:rgb(215,171,81);\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp;</span></span>（限购2次），预期为90刀，对比300杀价同样价格，按照3%池子五星计算，54000钻石&lt;4张光卷+500点火材料=60640钻石。所以这个礼包性价比高于300杀价，推荐一定氪金能力以上的人下手。</p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\"><br style=\"\"></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\"><br style=\"\"></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);\">3.</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,176,240);font-weight:bold;\">点火核心素材礼包</span>（限购3次）：五星卷1个+99随机点火素材。26刀，不值。</p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\"><br style=\"\"></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);\">4.</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,176,240);font-weight:bold;\">玛瑙金币礼包</span>：缺玛瑙的建议买玛瑙月卡，缺金币的最好是脚本刷刷raid，不用脚本但缺金币可以买。</p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\"><br style=\"\"></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);\">5.</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,176,240);font-weight:bold;\">核心素材礼包</span>：4*33素材=17刀，多次以及再次重申不值，智商税！</p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\"><br style=\"\"></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\">6.<span class=\"s1\" style=\"\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,176,240);font-weight:bold;\">魂卡礼包</span>：</span>240RMB 一张新魂卡闪卡、25个枕头保送+5,<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);\">&nbsp;</span><span class=\"s1\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);\">冲榜氪。</span></p><br></span><p></p>\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"\"></p><br><br style=\"\"><p></p>\n<p class=\"p1\" style=\"\"><br></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"\"></span></p>", "content_jso